   $q$Why did most farm children almost never borrow a book?$q$, $q$[{"text":"They had to drive the library wagon every Saturday instead.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"The library in the big town had no books for children to borrow.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"They lived far away from the only library in the county.","is_correct":true},{"text":"They did not like to read books about farming or crops at all.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$They lived far away from the only library in the county.$q$, $q$The first paragraph says the families lived far away, the roads were bumpy and few had cars, and "As a result" the children rarely borrowed books. Nothing says the children disliked reading.$q$, 'draft', 'b4f751f4-5862-5099-930e-b12c9155778d')
