   $q$What is the central message of the story?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The fastest player should always take the shot.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-lesson"},{"text":"Soccer games are hardest in the second half.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"detail-not-lesson"},{"text":"It is fine to lose as long as you are fast.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"A team does better when everyone works together.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$A team does better when everyone works together.$q$, $q$The Blue Hawks score only after Diego starts passing, and Diego says, "Our team scored three." Diego is the fastest, but shooting alone does not work.$q$, 'draft', '17cfe846-c625-52b6-9cac-397efd5bba2b')
