   $q$What does the speaker's choice to put off the fort show about the speaker?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The speaker does not really like building snow forts.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"The speaker puts a neighbor's needs ahead of fun.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The speaker was told by a parent to help out.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The speaker shovels mainly to earn a cup of cocoa.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The speaker puts a neighbor's needs ahead of fun.$q$, $q$The speaker wanted the fort but chose to spend an hour clearing a path for Mrs. Kowalski. The cocoa is a surprise at the end, so it was not the reason for helping.$q$, 'draft', 'cc18cf7a-49bd-53e9-b2c4-880fc8069d95')
