   $q$Which theme do both texts share?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Being honest builds trust with other people.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Older people should always fix their own nets.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"only-one-text"},{"text":"It is fine to keep a secret if no one finds out.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-meaning"},{"text":"Working at a market is better than fishing.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Being honest builds trust with other people.$q$, $q$In both texts honesty leads to a lasting friendship: the woman returns to shop, and Morag waves the young man home. Keeping a secret is the choice both characters reject.$q$, 'draft', '2a160408-a950-5c64-9826-5843d3edde0a')
